\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Kenya \highlight\uc2  cenbank won't  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  over shilling  \b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Februar 2006\par 12:33\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2006 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 (adds details)  \par \par \uc2 NAIVASHA, \b \highlight22\uc2 Kenya\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Feb 3 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Kenya\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets despite the current strength of the shilling against the U.S. dollar, governor Andrew Mullei said on Friday.  \par \par \uc2 "The CBK shall not take measures that influence the exchange position of exchange rate," he told reporters in the town of Naivasha, north of Nairobi, after opening a seminar.  \par \par \uc2 Mullei said there was no justification for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "The bank can only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if we see that the exchange rate is being influenced by speculative attacks which is not currently the case," he said.  \par \par \uc2 "Currently the exchange rate is influenced by growth in the supply and limited demand for (foreign) \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Kenya."  \par \par \uc2 Exporters say the strong shilling, trading around a 2-1/2 year high at 71.30/58 against the dollar, is seriously harming them. But Mullei sought to reassure them relief would come eventually.  \par \par \uc2 "In due course we shall see that the shilling exchange rate conforms to what might be of use to exporters," he said, adding that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to inject demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  would lead to inflationary pressure.  \par \par \uc2 "The CBK acts say that the Bank ensures that inflation is kept under control and thus we can't take action that perpetuates inflation," he added.  \par \par \uc2 ECONOMY-KENYA-CBANK (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|AFN|AFA|CSA|LBY|RWSA|RWS|REULB|GNS  \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020060206e223000vs\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
