\par\par \b \uc2  Kenya shilling falls vs dlr after testing 65 level. \b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Mai 2003\par 12:06\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2003 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     NAIROBI, May 13 (Reuters) - The Kenya shilling        shed\par its gains against the dollar on Tuesday after failing to breach\par a key resistance level and importers began to snap up the U.S.\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , dealers said.\par     At 0930 GMT, leading commercial banks posted the unit at\par 67.30/60 shillings to the dollar from its close of 66.65/75\par shillings on Monday. The unit earlier tested the key technical\par and psychological resistance level of 65, rising to a high of\par 65.35/45 against as banks sold dollars amidst subdued demand.\par     "It traded too much and people reached their trading\par (volume) limits," Kihara Maina, head of trading at Barclays Bank\par said. "Many banks have had to pull out."\par  \par     Dealers said that they had not seen any \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Kenya intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     The unit had appreciated rapidly against the dollar in early\par morning trade, drawing in importers.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     "65 was the target and we expected clients to come in at\par that level," Kennedy Butiko, a senior dealer at Credit Agricole\par Indosuez Bank said.\par     "A lot of corporates across the board are buying and some\par banks panicked."\par     Dealers said the local unit could weaken some more on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Wednesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The shilling will be in a consolidation phase between\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 67-69," Kihara said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par     But Butiko said that the unit may reverse once clients\par perceive the rates to be unfavourable.\par  \par                   ...........Shilling spot rates\par            ...............Shilling forward rates\par                      ..Cross rates\par                ............All Kenya Contributors\par               ........\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Kenya Index\par  \par                    ...............Kenyan Bonds contributor pages\par                    ..........Treasury bill yields\par                          .............Kenyan economic indicators\par     SPEED GUIDES:\par  \par     RELATED NEWS AND OTHER TOPICS:\par     All Kenyan news...........\par     Kenyan money and debt news.............\par     All Money news.............\par     Emerging Markets news...\par     Emerging Markets glance...........\par     African news.............\par     East African Diary...\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020030513dz5d00jx5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
