\par\par \b \uc2  Kenya shilling stable against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 356 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Mai 1999\par 11:57\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NAIROBI, May 4 (Reuters) - The Kenya shilling was steady against the dollar in thin trade on Tuesday as the local unit found support at the 67 level. \par \par \uc2  At 0930 GMT five leading banks posted the shilling at 67.65/75 against the dollar, slightly firmer from Monday's close of 67.80/95. \par \par \uc2  The shilling found support at 67 after the easing of a surge last week in demand for dollars, dealers said. Profit-taking had also lent support to the shilling, they said. \par \par \uc2  "We have seen exporters locking foward deals (at the same rate)," one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The Kenya shilling fell to an average of 67.44 to the dollar in the week to Tuesday from 65.77 in the same period the previous week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Kenya\b0 \highlight\uc2  (CBK) said. \par \par \uc2  The bank said it would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to prop up the shilling. \par \par \uc2  But it could enter the market to purchase \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  for three reasons - to cater for government and its maturing obligations, to increase bank reserves and to smooth over wide fluctuations in the shilling arising from non-economic fundamentals, it said. \par \par \uc2  "We still maintain our policy of leaving the shilling exchange rate to be determined by market forces of supply and demand," CBK's chief economist Maurice Kanga said in a statement. \par \par \uc2  Last week, dollar purchases to meet foreigners' portfolio investment leaving the market after sharp declines in treasury bills yield sent the shilling 2.5 percent lower against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hinted it would come into the market if the shilling looked like falling to the 70 level, comments that dealers said had helped shore up the local unit. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  posted a shilling mean indicative rate of 67.55 to the dollar from 67.61 at Monday's open. \par \par \uc2  Against the pound and euro, the bank quoted a shilling mean commercial rate of 108.96 and 71.56 respectively from 108.86 and 71.56 on Monday. ((Nairobi newsroom, +254 2 330261/2 fax +254 2 338860, nairobi.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv5401qjn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
