\par\par \b \uc2  Kenya  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  Market Braces For Further Shilling Fall \b0\par\par\uc2 208 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 1997\par 11:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones Commodities Service \par \uc2 DJCS\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  NAIROBI (Dow Jones)--The Kenyan \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was Thursday braced for further shilling declines, following the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's 4.6% drop against the dollar Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar opened Thursday at 66.50/68.50 shillings, up from Wednesday's closing at 65.90/68.00, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Kenya said. \par \par \uc2  'It's still early in the day. We're watching carefully... It depends on what orders come,' Charles Musawo, a \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer said. \par \par \uc2  He said the trend will be clearer at noon local time (0900 GMT). \par \par \uc2  The shilling's 4.6% fall on Wednesday brought its decline since Thursday to 13.6%. \par \par \uc2  There were bids as low as 69 shillings per dollar on Wednesday morning. The shilling's lowest level stands at 69.22 in October 1993. \par \par \uc2  The shilling's recovery from earlier lows followed comments from the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Kenya\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which said it would continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the shilling, and called for calm. \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wishes to re-affirm that it will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as and when justified,' \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Micah Cheserem said. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES COMMODITIES SERVICE 07-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0900GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument djcs000020011006dt8700x0o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
